    {
      "id": "claim_1c6507c7558247a79a81e49e97d68ea8",
      "statement": "`docs/PRD.md` is Indonesian-language intent documentation for a v0.1 draft, and the repository instruction in `AGENTS.md` makes source code and tests authoritative over briefs and docs, so PRD stages without code are roadmap rather than regressions.",
