        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c8e6f02c7ee74885a760d4f6329f7fdd",
      "statement": "Intake implements one gate: an open issue labeled `feature` on an opened/labeled/edited/reopened action is the only input; a missing required section causes a comment plus close, and only an issue that also carries `ready-for-agent` is enqueued as an `ImplementSpec` job.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Webhooks/GitHubWebhookProcessor.cs#L32-L102",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0960ba62d40379940aa380a36542389dd6610658c2f1b38d5e95109ede33cfb1:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0a4d6a9c057644bb95be5ca23bf7505f",
      "statement": "Spec validation runs before the `ready-for-agent` approval check and returns on failure, so a maintainer-approved issue with an empty required section is still closed as `not_planned`; the `ready-for-agent` label is only read from the event payload and never verifies which actor applied it or that the bot wrote it.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/GitHub/GitHubService.cs#L54-L69",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:aaa1a90091654b124874d660e3879e50f4ceb9302da726deeff522dd808f6ba8:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Webhooks/GitHubWebhookProcessor.cs#L61-L105",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:aa99cbd766b5437924316185fc25cae8e781379890405b45fb7261a29af86f4f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5dd1cfca98fc45f9a43e159228981bdb",
      "statement": "An issue labeled `bug` but not `feature` is ignored entirely, so no bug triage, `needs-triage` routing, or triage-trigger classification from the PRD exists in the code.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Webhooks/GitHubWebhookProcessor.cs#L20-L21",
