    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1f42918e281a4d31a3ee3738a0f9bb91",
      "statement": "The public HTTP trust boundary is the configured webhook HMAC secret rather than an auth scheme: `Program.cs` maps `/health` and `MapGitHubWebhooks(secret: config.GitHub.WebhookSecret)` with no authentication middleware registered.",
      "evidence": [
