    {
      "id": "claim_2b09dd2974ce4a02ac8ac26c461c92b2",
      "statement": "The single-repository constraint is enforced by an owner/name cross-check against the parsed `origin` inside `PrepareWorkspaceAsync`, which throws instead of redirecting when the webhook's issue repository does not match the local clone.",
